 gate: 'M3 21V4h18v17M7 21v-8m10 8v-8M7 8h10M7 13h10M7 17h10',
 chart: 'M3 3v18h18M7 16l4-5 4 2 6-8',
 book: 'M12 5v16M12 5C8 2 4 3 2 4v16c3-2 7-1 10 1 3-2 7-3 10-1V4c-3-1-6-2-10 1',
